WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
Delivery app, client project, 2025. Paid deliveries were being disputed. The records could not settle the claim.

00:04.500 --> 00:09.000
Field research with 5 drivers over 2 days: 80 to 130 stops a day, and the same data typed again at every door.

00:09.000 --> 00:20.167
The redesigned flow, in a prototype with invented data. Same screens as before: the route, the order, then the proof of delivery, which arrives already filled from the route data.
[Interface in Portuguese.]

00:20.167 --> 00:28.833
Who received the package, or where it was left: two labeled groups replace free text.

00:28.833 --> 00:40.767
Photo proof is checked at capture. A dark photo is flagged and taken again, and Deliver unlocks after two valid photos.

00:40.767 --> 00:46.267
Pilot with 12 drivers over 3 weeks: 7 to 8 seconds faster per stop, 2 fewer taps per stop, record compliance up from 92% to 98%.

00:46.267 --> 00:50.267
Same screens, stronger records. Research and UI, 2025. Client anonymized.
